      <title>最高法院再次拒绝特朗普复核卡罗尔判决的请求</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/08/17/us/trump-news/275fea82-9350-5fdb-a0e9-d98777a69ca8?smid=url-share</link>
